	column SecondsToTime = ```
			
			VAR TotalSeconds = fact_etl_log_overview_simple[DurationSeconds]
			VAR Minutes = TRUNC(TotalSeconds / 60)
			VAR Seconds = MOD(TotalSeconds, 60)
			RETURN 
			    FORMAT(Minutes, "00") & ":" & FORMAT(Seconds, "00")
			```
		lineageTag: 4e66d63c-be65-456b-ab36-3237144d1563
